WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:04.570
- GP, you've come up with
some new ways of saying

00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:08.460
and doing so many things,
that I wanted to tap you

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:12.540
to come up with some
euphemisms or Drew-phemisms

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:14.180
to have some alternative words

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:17.240
'cause it turns out in
the daytime TV space,

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:19.680
there are only certain words you can say

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:22.090
and certain words you can not say.

00:00:22.090 --> 00:00:23.750
Will you help me?

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:25.410
- Yes, I'll try.

00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:26.630
- Okay.

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:28.148
All right!

00:00:28.148 --> 00:00:29.130
(audience cheers)

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:32.060
Figuring out new language for daytime TV

00:00:32.060 --> 00:00:33.210
with my friend, GP.

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:36.740
Okay, Gwyneth, our control room
is on standby to cut us off

00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:38.980
if we say anything that goes too far.

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:41.450
All right, I need something for butt

00:00:41.450 --> 00:00:43.030
because you're only
allowed to stay it once

00:00:43.030 --> 00:00:43.950
and I just said it.

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:45.130
So help me.

00:00:45.130 --> 00:00:46.383
Go, GP!

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:49.053
- Derriere.

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:51.153
- Tuchus

00:00:53.460 --> 00:00:55.769
- Reserved seating?

00:00:55.769 --> 00:00:57.140
(audience laughs)

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:59.357
- Builtin beanbag chair,

00:00:59.357 --> 00:01:01.770
(audience laughs)

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:04.983
- The old Rumpelstiltskin.

00:01:04.983 --> 00:01:06.962
(audience laughs)

00:01:06.962 --> 00:01:07.795
(audience applauds)

00:01:07.795 --> 00:01:08.762
- Two scoops.

00:01:08.762 --> 00:01:11.650
(Gwyneth laughs)

00:01:11.650 --> 00:01:13.577
- The great divide.

00:01:13.577 --> 00:01:14.960
(Drew laughs)

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:17.460
(horn blares)

00:01:20.212 --> 00:01:23.630
- (laughs) Okay.

00:01:23.630 --> 00:01:26.380
Next, since we can't swear,

00:01:26.380 --> 00:01:30.800
I need alternative, AKA
Drew-phemisms for curse words.

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:31.863
GP, go.

00:01:33.310 --> 00:01:35.903
- What do we yell instead of a curse word?

00:01:37.432 --> 00:01:38.658
Phooey!

00:01:38.658 --> 00:01:40.400
- Crackers!

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:45.065
(laughs) Darn, darn my socks!

00:01:45.065 --> 00:01:45.924
(audience laughs)

00:01:45.924 --> 00:01:48.084
- Danga-a-lang-a-doo-dah!

00:01:48.084 --> 00:01:50.740
(audience laughs)

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:52.240
- Jimminy Cricket!

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:54.772
- Jimmy Fallon!

00:01:54.772 --> 00:01:57.355
(alarm sounds)

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:03.140
Our control room is going bananas.

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:07.350
Okay, we cannot refer to
another part of the anatomy,

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:10.340
and it starts with V and ends with ina.

00:02:10.340 --> 00:02:11.173
GP, go.

00:02:14.010 --> 00:02:15.840
- Lady bits.

00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:17.023
- Fine China.

00:02:18.034 --> 00:02:22.164
- (laughs) Pepperoni roll?

00:02:22.164 --> 00:02:23.210
(audience laughs)

00:02:23.210 --> 00:02:25.124
- Personal pan pizza.

00:02:25.124 --> 00:02:28.630
(audience laughs)

00:02:28.630 --> 00:02:30.833
- Life's cornucopia.

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:33.479
- I mean it is.

00:02:33.479 --> 00:02:34.880
(Gwyneth laughs)

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:37.295
- Little pat a buttah.

00:02:37.295 --> 00:02:38.463
(audience laughs)

00:02:38.463 --> 00:02:40.850
(Gwyneth laughs)

00:02:40.850 --> 00:02:42.752
- Lone mitten.

00:02:42.752 --> 00:02:45.752
(explosion rumbles)

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:53.120
- In the honor of the Zucker brothers

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:54.677
and old school Nickelodeon,

00:02:54.677 --> 00:02:56.760
"You Can't Do That on Television",

00:02:56.760 --> 00:03:00.840
that was Drew-phemisms with
none other than the genius,

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:03.027
brilliant goddess Gwyneth Paltrow.

00:03:03.027 --> 00:03:05.610
(upbeat music)

00:03:07.782 --> 00:03:09.870
♪ Ah ah ah oh ♪

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:11.364
♪ Ah ah ah oh ♪

